{"id":"ucan-agil","qid":"Q47455582","category":"site","type":"site","names":{"az":"Uçan ağıl","ru":"Учан-Агиль","en":"Uçan ağıl"},"coordinates":[45.508,39.291],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":null,"regionSource":null,"admin":[],"firstRecord":null,"period":null,"forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Uçan ağıl — Naxçıvan Muxtar Respublikasının Babək rayonu ərazisində qədim yaşayış yeri. Yaşayış yeri rayonun Sirab kəndindən şimalda yerləşir.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Учан-Агиль (азерб. Uçan ağıl) — археологический памятник в Нахичеванской Автономной Республике, к северу от села Сираб Бабекского района.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Uçan ağıl is an archaeological site north of Sirab village in Babek District of Nakhchivan Autonomous Republic, Azerbaijan. It is located at the altitude of 1200 m a.s.l. in the Sirab piedmonts, in the upper reaches of Sirab Suyu river along with other sites from the same period, Sorsu, and Zirinclik. It is dated at ca 4850-4350 BC time span, but was also occupied in the 3rd millennium BC. Uçan Ağıl was likely used by mobile pastoralists on a seasonal basis. They mostly pastured herds of goats.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/U%C3%A7an_a%C4%9F%C4%B1l.jpg/960px-U%C3%A7an_a%C4%9F%C4%B1l.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/U%C3%A7an_a%C4%9F%C4%B1l.jpg/960px-U%C3%A7an_a%C4%9F%C4%B1l.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":533,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:U%C3%A7an_a%C4%9F%C4%B1l.jpg","title":"Uçan ağıl.jpg","artist":"Elmar Baxşəliyev","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata"